00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:07.100
[Money for Nothing by
Dire Straits] ♪ MTV...

2
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.870
[music]

3
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.750
[rustling]

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.074
Do you want subtitles for any video?
